310
00:14:34,210 --> 00:14:38,490
If you want to put it nicely — entertainer.

311
00:14:38,490 --> 00:14:40,170
Hmm...

312
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:43,960
Hmm...

313
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,020
