329
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:18,850
Huh?

330
00:15:18,850 --> 00:15:19,350
What?

331
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:22,490
The stuff inside~

332
00:15:22,490 --> 00:15:22,990
Um...

333
00:15:22,990 --> 00:15:26,070
Hitting it isn't fixing it

334
00:15:26,070 --> 00:15:26,570


335
00:15:26,570 --> 00:15:28,230
The stuff inside — wait, seriously?

336
00:15:28,230 --> 00:15:30,790
The stuff inside...

337
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:31,330
Huh?

338
00:15:31,330 --> 00:15:32,430
Huh?

339
00:15:32,430 --> 00:15:34,330
"Huh?" lmao

340
00:15:34,330 --> 00:15:35,630
Huh!

341
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,270
All I can do is push now

342
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:38,830
Huh!

343
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:39,970
What's the situation?

344
00:15:39,970 --> 00:15:41,610
Give it back!

345
00:15:41,610 --> 00:15:46,870
Could it be a location issue?

346
00:15:46,870 --> 00:15:49,110
It was the usual stuff

347
00:15:49,110 --> 00:15:51,790
But pushing isn't doing anything

348
00:15:51,790 --> 00:15:54,150
No way...

349
00:15:54,150 --> 00:15:56,350
It's gone

350
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:58,750
