351
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:01,190
Right, can't take out the fuel either

352
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:02,730
So it's just broken then

353
00:16:02,730 --> 00:16:03,950
It's broken

354
00:16:03,950 --> 00:16:05,870
Wow, so they can just break like that

355
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:10,290
No way

356
00:16:10,290 --> 00:16:14,350
