391
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,120
There are horses

392
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:15,460
There are horses

393
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:18,180
The camper's better though

394
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:25,090
