466
00:22:12,850 --> 00:22:14,130
Luna

467
00:22:14,130 --> 00:22:15,350
Luna?

468
00:22:15,350 --> 00:22:17,550
Luna, don't just suddenly — stop doing that

469
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:21,840
