495
00:24:00,610 --> 00:24:04,910
It's not here, is it?

496
00:24:04,910 --> 00:24:08,610
The tank was right around here yesterday...

497
00:24:08,410 --> 00:24:13,410
Wait, I can hear something like an entrance sound too, right? Yeah yeah yeah yeah

498
00:24:13,410 --> 00:24:17,410


