00:24:19,410 --> 00:24:22,410
It's gone? Wait, is it there? Huh?

501
00:24:22,410 --> 00:24:25,410
Huh? Huh? Huh?

502
00:24:25,410 --> 00:24:27,410
Tank?

503
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:33,410
