505
00:24:40,650 --> 00:24:42,450
Where'd it go?

506
00:24:42,450 --> 00:24:45,350
Huh?

507
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:47,350
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

508
00:24:47,350 --> 00:24:49,150
Huh? Huh? Huh?

509
00:24:49,150 --> 00:24:51,040
Huh?

510
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:52,750
Huh?

511
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:54,750
It's not here!

512
00:24:54,750 --> 00:24:56,550
Huh? Huh?

513
